member.summary:
Writes the ASP.NET Core  as a compact, machine-readable JSON document for the
admin-facing /health endpoint (NF-09). Shape:

{
  "status": "Healthy",
  "generatedAt": "2026-08-31T21:40:00Z",
  "checks": [
    { "name": "store", "status": "Healthy", "durationMs": 3, "data": { "roundTripMs": 3 } },
    { "name": "sync",  "status": "Healthy", "durationMs": 5, "data": { ... } }
  ]
}

data is omitted when a check reports none. No secrets are ever included.
